-- A ticket card for the desk: red enamel and a gold signature on the front, chrome and black mirror on the back.
create a card called desk-ticket from brass, 0.8 mm thick.
on the front.
enamel the card in #a8141d.
draw a bezel called frame.
plate the frame with chrome.
sign "ADMIT ONE" at 620 900.
plate the signature with gold.
on the back.
plate the card with black mirror.
draw a bezel called back-frame.
plate the back-frame with chrome.
